<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Payment Overdue – 30 Days Reminder" recipientType="User" relatedToType="SalesOrderInstallments__c">
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >
<html>
   <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
     <div style="text-align: center;">
          <!-- <img src="{!URLFOR($Resource.CustomerCommunitcationHeader)}" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;" />-->
          <img src="http://cdn.mcauto-images-production.sendgrid.net/e8b0a57e5c62d448/faec48e3-ed7c-4bd7-8c65-56e42990cc99/3000x481.jpg" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"/>

        </div>
        <div style="background-color: #f2f2f2; padding: 15px; text-align: Left;">
  <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">Default SR</div>
</div>
     <!--<div style="margin: 0px 20% 0 15%;border: 2px solid black;padding: 2px;">-->
         <table style="text-align:justify;width: 100%;">
           <tr>
             <td colspan="2">
                &nbsp;
             </td>
           </tr>
           <tr>
              <td colspan="2" style="">
                  Dear {!relatedTo.SalesOrder__r.CustomerAccount__r.Name},              </td>
           </tr>
           <tr>
             <td colspan="2">
                &nbsp;
             </td>
           </tr>
           <tr>
            <td colspan="2" style="">
            

This is a reminder that your payment has been overdue for 30 days. As a result, your account is currently marked as defaulted.

To address this, a Default Service Request has been automatically created on your behalf for further processing.

We request you to make the pending payment at the earliest to avoid further action.

If you have already made the payment, please disregard this message.

For any queries, feel free to reach out to our support team.
                <b></b> <br/><br/>

              

            </td>
           </tr>
           <tr>
             <td colspan="2" style="">
               <br/>Best regards,<br/><br/><b>Customer Management Team</b>
             </td>
           </tr>        
         </table>
             
     <!-- Footer -->
<div style="text-align: Left; background-color: #f2f2f2; padding: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin-top: 30px;">
<a><b> modon.com</b></a>
<!--<<a href="https://modon.com" style="color: #1F4393; text-decoration: none;">modon.com</a>-->
</div>
<!--</div>-->
  </body>
</html>
</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>